Default language mismatch: This script defaults to 'tr,en' but the workflow file `.github/workflows/poeditor-sync.yml` (line 58) defaults to 'tr,gb'. This inconsistency could cause unexpected behavior when the workflow runs on schedule without manual input.

```suggestion
-const LANGUAGES = (process.env.LANGUAGES || 'tr,en').split(',');
+const LANGUAGES = (process.env.LANGUAGES || 'tr,gb').split(',');
```

